p muscles\n- human skull bones", "short_description": "This is an educational game which combines the 3D puzzles and human anatomy based on detailed and accurate models of human organs, bones or muscles.\n\nCompete against time in easy, medium or hard modes to complete:\n- human skeleton bones\n- human digestive and respiratory system\n- human top muscles\n- human skull bones"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://qj3v3zpjt5rlmhkuzx2pnw.on.drv.tw/Web/AnatomyPuzzleVRPolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Micha\u0142 Gulbicki", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.facebook.com/anatomypuzzlequest.2025/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9523517044408629"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982535_3647486208693157_7908003270627345564_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dKI6dRTLDKQQ7kNvwGeNRrf&_nc_oc=AdnA5_wk9TYzESFDJD2rI8cIuOy3xrZS828S7JCMWRC5g7V7KEHH5xvsWhey8kynxJE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afyt78QIbiO66R5AwfTIWKWcohTQ-makGjFTuKVTiyoQXw&oe=69B9457F"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Human Anatomy Puzzle", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "c